{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. The one address of the wishlist, printed with no spaces:
    {%- render 'wishlist-url' -%}
  - a store page with the handle "wishlist" on the Wishlist page template
    (templates/page.wishlist.json) when the merchant has made one;
  - otherwise the theme's own Wishlist template on the search route,
    /search?view=wishlist (templates/search.wishlist.json), which every store
    has, so the wishlist works with nothing to set up.
  A theme cannot create pages, so the second one is the default.
  Storelib: the wishlist is Storelib's own page at /pages/wishlist (kept in
  step with the website's wishlist), so that is the address when the store
  has no page of its own.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign wishlist_page = pages['wishlist']
  if wishlist_page != empty and wishlist_page.url != blank and wishlist_page.template_suffix == 'wishlist'
    echo wishlist_page.url
  else
    echo '/pages/wishlist'
  endif
-%}
